    "detailed_description": "<strong>Moonport</strong> is a side-scrolling, real time strategy, space colony simulation with roguelike elements. You play as a brave space explorer who aspires to colonize the moons of Saturn. How many moons can you conquer?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Explore</strong> strange moons.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Expand</strong> your base.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Exploit</strong> the resources.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Exterminate</strong> the hostile natives.</ul><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></strong><br>Earn many unique items which change your strategy.<br>Fight through hordes of different enemies and bosses.<br>Discover 10 moons with different enemies, resources, and strategies needed to defeat.<br>Unlock new items to keep the game fresh with each playthrough.<br>Save your best highscores.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807510/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.poster.avif?t=1718996083\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807510/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.webm?t=1718996083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807510/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.mp4?t=1718996083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Moonport</strong> is a side-scrolling, real time strategy, space colony simulation with roguelike elements. You play as a brave space explorer who aspires to colonize the moons of Saturn. How many moons can you conquer?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Explore</strong> strange moons.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Expand</strong> your base.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Exploit</strong> the resources.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Exterminate</strong> the hostile natives.</ul><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></strong><br>Earn many unique items which change your strategy.<br>Fight through hordes of different enemies and bosses.<br>Discover 10 moons with different enemies, resources, and strategies needed to defeat.<br>Unlock new items to keep the game fresh with each playthrough.<br>Save your best highscores.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807510/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.poster.avif?t=1718996083\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807510/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.webm?t=1718996083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807510/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.mp4?t=1718996083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
